**Title:** Gentle Shores and Grateful Hearts

**Description:** Drift into a peaceful slumber with the soothing tale of Arlo, an eleven-year-old boy with a heart full of gratitude, as he embarks on a tranquil journey along a serene coastal shoreline. Accompanied by his spirited seagull companion, Breeze, Arlo savors the gentle lull of the ocean waves and the vibrant hues of the setting sun. Together, they uncover simple treasures and the profound connection between nature and gratitude. Designed to ease anxiety and foster emotional calm, this sleep story wraps you in the comforting embrace of nature’s gentle lullaby, guiding you lovingly towards the restful shores of sleep.

